00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.120
Mada Shiranai

00:03:10.620 --> 00:03:12.120
Aún no lo sé

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:18.010
Hakanai Subete no Mirai wa

00:03:12.210 --> 00:03:18.010
